WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.002
-Here's how the game works.

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.169
Tyler, you're gonna
start the round

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.404
by pressing start
on this buzzer

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:06.306
and then draw a clue
from the top of the pile.

00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:08.141
You have to get your partner
to guess the clue

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:10.243
as quickly as possible,
then hand the buzzer off

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:11.811
to the person on your right.

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:13.313
You can make
any physical gesture,

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:15.081
say whatever you want,
except you can't say

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:16.549
any word in the actual clue.

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:17.650
If you're holding the buzzer --

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.018
Sorry.
There's more information.

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:20.820
-Yeah, I'm with you.
-If you're holding the buzzer

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.156
when it goes off,
your team loses that round.

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:25.024
-Dude, we got it!
-We're gonna play.

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:26.292
-All right.
-Here we go.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.161
Tyler, yeah, you start out.
-Start it? Press it?

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:31.097
-Yep.
[ Timer beeping ]

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:33.799
-Um, uh...
if I throw this at you,

00:00:33.799 --> 00:00:35.501
and you try to get away from it,
and it --

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.270
-A dodgeball.
-Yes! Now what?

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.804
-That's it. Oh, good.
Now Tariq has to -- Good.

00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:41.107
-Okay.
[ Beeping continues ]

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:44.244
-Also known as a tramp stamp.
